3-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p005","quote":"天子使莊助往諭意南越王，胡頓首曰：「天子乃為臣興兵討閩越，死無以報德！」遣太子嬰齊入宿衛。謂助曰：「國新被寇，使者行矣。胡方日夜裝入見天子。」助去後，其大臣諫胡曰：「漢興兵誅郢，亦行以驚動南越。且先王昔言，事天子期無失禮，要之不可以說好語入見。入見則不得復歸，亡國之勢也。」於是胡稱病，竟不入見。後十餘歲，胡實病甚，太子嬰齊請歸。胡薨，謚為文王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji113-014:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p005","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"太子","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0039","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授受事件與文獻用稱分存；原文沒有確切任期終點則保留未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。故濟北相為追述舊官；去帝制與國內仍用帝號的差異另待處理。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji113-033","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","title":"明王","kind":"honorific","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p006","quote":"嬰齊代立，即藏其先武帝璽。嬰齊其入宿衛在長安時，取邯鄲樛氏女，生子興。及即位，上書請立樛氏女為后，興為嗣。漢數使使者風諭嬰齊，嬰齊尚樂擅殺生自恣，懼入見要用漢法，比內諸侯，固稱病，遂不入見。遣子次公入宿衛。嬰齊薨，謚為明王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji113-033:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p006","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"明王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0000","usage":"posthumous_usage","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"薨後明示謚號，用稱標為死後；不作生前王號或補造授謚年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"parent_person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv","scope":"sons_of_parent","ordinal":1,"position":"eldest","interpretation_status":"source_attested","assertion_id":"a-shiji113-007","person_id":"f4l_jyl_oqv_C","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","quote":"天子聞嘉不聽王，王、王太后弱孤不能制，使者怯無